  "title": "8. Sub-surface exposure windows (the North Minch; notional)",
  "about": "A blue submarine in the North Minch needs to raise a mast to talk to a notional shore control on Lewis. Red has a maritime patrol aircraft on a racetrack over the Minch (on station T+0 to T+60 and from T+120; radar and ESM), a frigate working west across the southern North Minch with its own radar and ESM, and a second ES/DF ship off Rubha Reidh. Use Exposure in the EMO dock to find where and when a UHF, satcom or HF mast can go up, or just a periscope. All values notional.",
